    <div class="lesson-head">
      <div class="lesson-heading">
        <div class="lesson-number"><div class="heading-md">1</div></div>
        <div class="lesson-title"><h2 class="heading-md">The Basics of Easing</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-desc">
        <p class="body-md">
          In nature, the speed of movement is never linear: objects gain speed as they begin to move, and slow as they come to a halt. Easing is the technique
          that allows us to convey this.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
